markdown <<MARKDOWN
<h1>Section 2: What Is AI, Really?</h1>

<div style="display: inline-block; background-color: #E4E2F8; color: #1F1976; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Aligns to curriculum Lessons 1-2</div>

<p>This section prepares you to teach two curriculum lessons. Before students write a line of Python, they need a working definition of intelligence itself, one that doesn't collapse into "robots" or "chatbots." That's why the unit opens here.</p>

<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
  <div style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;"><b>Curriculum Lesson 1:</b> What is Intelligence?</div>
  <a href="PASTE_AIF_Y2_UNIT_1_LESSON_1_URL_HERE" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px;">View Curriculum Lesson 1</a>
</div>

<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
  <div style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;"><b>Curriculum Lesson 2:</b> AI's Past, Present, and Future</div>
  <a href="PASTE_AIF_Y2_UNIT_1_LESSON_2_URL_HERE" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px;">View Curriculum Lesson 2</a>
</div>

<hr>

<p><b>In this section, you'll:</b></p>
<div style="margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 16px;">&bull; Sort real AI examples, a chess engine, a chatbot, a thermostat, a recommendation feed, into categories, surfacing that "AI" isn't one single thing</div>
<div style="margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 16px;">&bull; Preview the movie-AI-vs-real-AI misconception and how to redirect it without shutting the conversation down</div>
<div style="margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 16px;">&bull; Walk through AI's interdisciplinary roots, linguistics, math, and psychology, condensed to what's actually useful to teach from</div>
<div style="margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 16px;">&bull; Preview the discussion notes for the history-timeline activity your students will do</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px;">&bull; Close with a reflection prompt that ties both curriculum lessons together</div>

<div style="background-color: #E4E2F8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 16px 0;">
  <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #222222; line-height: 1.5;"><b>&#128161; Notice as you explore:</b> how sorting examples into buckets teaches the definition of intelligence more effectively than stating it in one sentence would, and how the movie-AI misconception is really an opening to hear what students already believe before correcting it.</div>
</div>

<hr>

<div style="display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 24px; max-width: 700px;">
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #ACA8EA; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px;">Section 1</div>
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px;">Section 2</div>
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #ACA8EA; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1.5px solid #E4E2F8;">Section 3</div>
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #ACA8EA; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1.5px solid #E4E2F8;">Section 4</div>
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #ACA8EA; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1.5px solid #E4E2F8;">Section 5</div>
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #ACA8EA; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1.5px solid #E4E2F8;">Section 6</div>
